    "created_at": "2016-04-19T08:11:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-19T08:11:39Z",
    "body": "No strong opinions on the crop rectangle case but if padding usually works (when crop rect is larger than the source), if makes sense to allow it if the image is empty too.\n",
